izzat hain kya veqaar hain kya ehteram hai<br>
soncho to eak pal ke liye kya maqaam hain<br>
bimaar-e-karbala ka yeh hum ko payam hain<br>
aye momino hussain ka tum par salam hai<br>
<br>
1. farsh-e-aza bichao karo majlis-e-hussain<br>
dengi duwaein tumko muhammed ki noor-e-ain<br>
is gham mein chaho jitna karo kam hain shor-o-shain<br>
bimaar-e-karbala ka yeh hum ko payam hain<br>
<br>
2. har gaam karbala thi shah-e-mashraqain ko<br>
ghurbat mein chain kab mila zehra ke chain ko<br>
asghar ke baad hogayi fursath hussain ko<br>
bimaar-e-karbala ka yeh hum ko payam hain<br>
<br>
3. maqsad ki aabroo hain saahadat hussain ki<br>
maqtal mein charsu hai shahadat hussain ki<br>
ta hashr surq rooh hain shahadat hussain ki<br>
bimaar-e-karbala ka yeh hum ko payam hain<br>
<br>
4. maa bain-e-kayenath ye tanha hai waqaya<br>
piri mein noujavan ka laasha uthaliya<br>
mazloom yeh hussain pe hai raat e ambiya<br>
bimaar-e-karbala ka yeh hum ko payam hain<br>
<br>
5. aakhon mein aaj tak hai woh manzar hussain ka<br>
zakhmon se chur chur tha paikar hussain ka<br>
veeran ho chuka tha bhara ghar hussain ka<br>
bimaar-e-karbala ka yeh hum ko payam hain<br>
<br>
6. hangam-e-asr jiski shahadat hai momino<br>
uska hi zikr taab-a-qayamat hai momino<br>
yeh gham manao ain-e-ibadath hai momino<br>
bimaar-e-karbala ka yeh hum ko payam hain<br>
<br>
7. aye momino qayaal rahe dil mein ye sada<br>
wo dashte karbala ho ke majlis-e-aza<br>
jannat se farsh-e-qaak pe ati hain fatima<br>
bimaar-e-karbala ka yeh hum ko payam hain<br>
<br>
8. yeh majlise yeh zikr yeh matam yeh marsie<br>
mashko alam yeh phool yeh jhola yeh tazie<br>
yeh sab nashaniya hai aza-e-hussain ke<br>
bimaar-e-karbala ka yeh hum ko payam hain<br>
<br>
9. taskeen e khalbe fatima yeh gham yeh anjuman<br>
qayam rahe fareed yeh matam yeh anjuman<br>
ahle aza se kehti hai hardam yeh anjuman<br>
bimaar-e-karbala ka yeh hum ko payam hain